Analysis samples

A significant challenge of support engineering is identifying and navigating the path from symptoms of a problem a customer has presented to its root causes.  You must ask the right questions, leverage your team and research to narrow in on the cause, and maintain a calm bedside manner throughout.  Please provide an analysis sample: a written analysis of a particular customer issue from some point in your career. If such an analysis is not readily available (as it might not be if one’s work has been strictly proprietary), please recount an incident in which you analyzed customer system misbehavior, including as much technical detail as you can recall.

